+# Mobile/Qt Feature Parity Matrix
+
+> Generated from `docs/mobile/remote-command-catalog.yaml`; edit the catalog, not this table.
+
+Execution modes: `direct`, `signed-inbox`, `node-execution`, `mobile-equivalent`, `not-applicable`.
+
+`node-execution` runs locally on the requesting registered node when it advertises the enabled atomic capability.
+If local execution is unavailable, the user may optionally route a typed request to another trusted eligible node.
+It does not require Qt or pairing.
+
+## account
+
+| Capability | User outcome | Mode | Risk | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `account.email.verify` | Verify account email as administrator | direct | write | planned |
+| `account.login` | Log in | direct | write | implemented |
+| `account.logout` | Log out this device | direct | write | partial |
+| `account.profile.update` | Edit account profile | direct | write | planned |
+| `account.signup` | Create account | direct | write | implemented |
+| `voice.dictate` | Dictate text | mobile-equivalent | secret | planned |
+| `voice.microphone.test` | Test mobile microphone | mobile-equivalent | read | planned |
+
+## actions
+
+| Capability | User outcome | Mode | Risk | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `action.approve` | Approve protected workflow | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `action.artifact.delete` | Delete action artifact | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `action.artifact.download` | Download verified action artifact | direct | read | planned |
+| `action.cancel` | Cancel workflow | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `action.dispatch` | Dispatch workflow | node-execution | write | planned |
+| `action.fix_agent` | Fix failed workflow with agent | node-execution | write | planned |
+| `action.history.clear` | Clear workflow run history | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `action.read` | Read workflows runs and logs | direct | read | partial |
+| `action.reject` | Reject pending workflow run | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `action.rerun` | Rerun workflow | node-execution | write | planned |
+| `action.variable.delete` | Delete workflow variable | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `action.variable.export` | Export workflow variables and secrets | node-execution | secret | planned |
+| `action.variable.import` | Import workflow variables and secrets | node-execution | secret | planned |
+| `action.variable.list` | List workflow variables | node-execution | read | planned |
+| `action.variable.reveal` | Reveal workflow variable secret | node-execution | secret | planned |
+| `action.variable.set` | Set workflow variable or secret | node-execution | secret | planned |
+| `action.workflow.toggle` | Enable or disable workflow | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `workflow.native` | Run native workflow | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `workflow.wasm` | Run sandboxed WASM workflow | node-execution | write | planned |
+
+## agent-tools
+
+| Capability | User outcome | Mode | Risk | Status |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `tool.docker` | Run Docker tool for agent | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `tool.files.create` | Create repository file for agent | node-execution | write | planned |
+| `tool.files.delete` | Delete repository file for agent | node-execution | destructive | planned |
+| `tool.files.list` | List repository files for agent | node-execution | read | planned |
+| `tool.files.read` | Read repository file for agent | node-execution | read | planned |
+| `tool.files.search` | Search repository files for agent | node-execution | read | planned |
+| `tool.files.write` | Write repository file for agent | node-execution | write | planned |
+| `tool.git.diff` | Read Git diff for agent | node-execution | read | planned |
